{"id":"aspecto","lemma":"aspecto","pos":"noun","rank":1225,"glosses":["aspect","appearance, look"],"ipa":"/asˈpeɡto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"aspectos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-aspecto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él tenía buen aspecto.","en":"He looked well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34869"},{"text":"La imaginación afecta a todos los aspectos de nuestra vida.","en":"Imagination affects every aspect of our lives.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/12253"},{"text":"Tienes un aspecto horrible.","en":"You look awful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/41656"},{"text":"He fallado en todos los aspectos.","en":"I've failed in every respect."},{"text":"¿Qué aspecto tenía Tom?","en":"How did Tom look?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/107056"}]}